    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\n`-` from an unnamed buffer opens the parent of the current directory.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nOpen the effective current directory when the buffer has no name.",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-23T15:13:41Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I'm not sure that behavior is more intuitive than the current (admittedly unexpected) one. \r\n\r\nI'd rather restrict the `-` normal mode command to `ft=directory` buffers.\r\n\r\nIn any case, I think the expected behavior should first be discussed in an issue.",
            "created_at": "2026-07-23T15:13:41Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40921#issuecomment-5060106741",
            "id": 5060106741,
            "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/40921",
            "minimized": null,
